This commit introduces the `stmmac_rx_buf2_len` function, which contains the vulnerable logic. Specifically, in lines 3485-3487, the code returns `priv->dma_buf_sz` when the descriptor is not the last descriptor (`status & rx_not_ls`): 

c
	/* Not last descriptor */
	if (status & rx_not_ls)
